      "y": -50,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 🏢 注目企業\n- [[Entities/NVIDIA|NVIDIA]]\n\n### ⚙️ 注目技術\n- [[Technologies/fine-tuning|fine-tuning]]\n- [[Technologies/LLM|LLM]]\n- [[Technologies/diffusion|diffusion]]\n- [[Technologies/LoRA|LoRA]]\n- [[Technologies/PEFT|PEFT]]\n- [[Technologies/tool use|tool use]]\n- [[Technologies/Rust|Rust]]"
